          "ruleIndex": 39,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "session_cookie_secure defaults to False in config.py line 23. set_session_cookies() in security.py uses is_secure_request() which trusts X-Forwarded-Proto from any upstream \u2014 not just a known trusted proxy. A session cookie without the Secure flag can be captured by a network attacker on HTTP connections."
          },
          "locations": [
