          "ruleIndex": 43,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "validation.py lines 52-60: the policy checks isalpha() and isdigit() but has no check for special characters. A password 'Aaaaaaaaaaaa1' (13 chars, 1 letter, 1 digit) would be accepted, providing minimal entropy beyond length."
