            "text": "portfolio.py lines 700-717: public_portfolio_collection returns PublicPortfolioCollectionRead which includes student_id, entry titles, dates, tags, subject, and assignment details. While intentional for the sharing feature, the response includes internal IDs (student_id) and potentially sensitive academic PII that could be aggregated."
