              "description": {
                "text": "Omit internal database IDs (student_id, entry IDs) from the public portfolio response. Replace with opaque tokens or short names. Add an optional password or expiration to public share links. Consider whether the share token (UUID4) provides sufficient access control given it never expires."
              }
            }
