          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "config.py line 68 and .env.example line 55: FAMILY_PASSWORD=changeme. Even if this password is 'legacy', if it is used anywhere in auth logic (e.g., during an upgrade path or fallback flow), an attacker who knows the default value could impersonate any account."
          },
          "locations": [
