              "description": {
                "text": "Add this field to the placeholder secrets set in startup.py's _PLACEHOLDER_SECRETS check. Require operators to explicitly set FAMILY_PASSWORD to a non-default value or explicitly remove it. Document which migration versions require it."
              }
