            "text": ".env.example line 48: BOOTSTRAP_OWNER_EMAIL=owner@homeschool-hero.local. An attacker targeting a Homeschool Hero installation can attempt to login with this known email address combined with brute-forced or common passwords. Lockout protects after 5 failures but the email address itself is an attack aid."
