          "ruleIndex": 63,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "submissions.py lines 201-207 calls normalize_upload_type(file.filename, file.content_type, ...). A client can upload an executable or script file with Content-Type: image/jpeg and the application will accept it as a JPEG. The file is then processed by PIL/PyMuPDF based on this declared type, creating potential parser confusion attacks."
          },
